  "raw_text": "Step 1: Calculate the total enrollment of both grades.\nTotal enrollment = 520 (7th grade) + 650 (8th grade) = 1170\n\nStep 2: Determine the proportion of students in the 8th grade.\nProportion of 8th grade = 650 / 1170\n\nStep 3: Calculate the number of representatives for the 8th grade based on its proportion of the total enrollment.\nRepresentatives for 8th grade = (650 / 1170) * 18\n\nStep 4: Simplify the calculation.\nRepresentatives for 8th grade = (650 * 18) / 1170\n\nStep 5: Perform the multiplication and division.\nRepresentatives for 8th grade = 11700 / 1170 = 10\n\nFinal answer: \\boxed{10}<|im_end|>",
